],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025, September to October came in at 32% of normal on the middle. In 2026 so far, April to May sits at 155% of normal on the middle. Grid 10932 had its driest year in 1956 at 42%.</p>"}
